! !CHECK on line 13 tests the indicator and modifier bits and NOT
! the address.
!
! >>> AND THE PAGE IS REFERENCED FROM OUTSIDE. <<<  The OCR of
! printed p.213 prints "220645.40  215471.04 C0" -- a BD whose
! 19-bit target is 215471.00, this page's S IF AE.  So line 5's
! label and its address are corroborated by a card on another page.
!
! MCP's names carry blanks ("S TLR", "M OP C I", "MR3 AD") and the
! listing prints them inconsistently (line 15 "M OP CI", line 17
