! address).  As in every deck here the blanks are dropped and the
! name is written solid; the printed form is kept verbatim in the
! listing block below.
! ---------------------------------------------------------------

STLR    SYN, (8)215230.0             ! lines 5,6,7,28 "S TLR"
STIC    SYN, (8)215265.0             ! lines 9,33 "S TIC" -- p112's spelling
MKMCPA  SYN, (8)215566.40            ! line 12 "MKMCPA"
